<title>The Louisiana Architect - Page 6</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
    background-color: #fff;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 40px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .page-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 900px;
  }
